  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Parlamentsst&#xf6;d - f&#xf6;rstudie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parlamentsst&#xf6;d - prestudy - Parlamentsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna f&#xf6;rstudie om parlamentsst&#xf6;d best&#xe4;lldes fr&#xe5;n Overseas Development Institute (ODI) 2011. Syftet med studien &#xe4;r att  sammanst&#xe4;lla vilken kunskap som finns hos givare kring olika metoder och ansatser inom parlamentsst&#xf6;d och metodernas effektivitet, samt att identifiera viktiga kunskapsluckor och bed&#xf6;ma behovet av en &quot;multi-stakeholder&quot; tematisk utv&#xe4;rdering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Pre-Study on Parliamentary Development Assistance (PDA) was commissioned from the Overseas Development Institute (ODI) in 2011. The purpose is to review the state of knowledge on donor approaches to PDA and their effectiveness since 2005, identify key gaps in knowledge, and assess the need for a multi-stakeholder thematic evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
